297
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:50,273
To je ale luxusní oběd!

298
00:16:50,296 --> 00:16:54,498
Vezmu si tonkatsu bento a makunouči bento.

299
00:16:54,521 --> 00:16:57,388
Takže za oba dohromady 600 korun, že?

300
00:16:57,411 --> 00:17:00,219
Máte i čaj ve slevě?

301
00:17:00,242 --> 00:17:04,280
Ano, čaj je o 20 % levnější!

302
00:17:04,304 --> 00:17:07,275
